Zode
====

Zode is a fork of Zed (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed), the code
editor built by Zed Industries, Inc. and its contributors.

This fork removes Zed's authentication, cloud, AI/agent, collaboration,
edit-prediction, auto-update, and crash-reporting subsystems, in order to
produce an independent editor with no account, no telemetry, and no network
egress beyond what the user explicitly asks for (extension installs and
language-server downloads). None of the changes made in this fork are
endorsed by, affiliated with, or supported by Zed Industries, Inc.

